      "content": "PROGRESS.md (lines 1-46 of 46)\n1: # Progress\n2: \n3: This file is maintained by Dahl Studio. It records the current task, the plan and a log of every task, so work can\n4: continue reliably across sessions and models. You can add your own notes outside the marked sections.\n5: \n6: <!-- dahl:current -->\n7: ## Current task\n8: - Status: in progress\n9: - Started: 10/29/2026, 12:59:27 PM\n10: - Mode: build | Model: dahl:MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7 | Thinking: high\n11: - Request: Continue\n12: <!-- /dahl:current -->\n13: \n14: <!-- dahl:plan -->\n15: ## Plan\n16: (no plan yet)\n17: <!-- /dahl:plan -->\n18: \n19: <!-- dahl:log -->\n20: ## Task log\n21: \n22: ### 10/29/2026, 12:53:18 PM | failed | build | dahl:MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7\n23: \n24: **Request:** # JCROWN DIGITALS — PREMIUM BLACK & GOLD PERSONAL BRAND WEBSITE Act as a senior UI/UX designer, personal-brand copywriter, and full-stack web developer. Build a beautiful, modern, fully functional personal-brand landing page for **JCROWN DIGITALS**, owned by **Jediah Akeredolu**. This website should focus on Jediah as the person behind the brand, his work, his digital books, and the value visitors can get from his publications. It should not look like a traditional e-commerce store. ## 1. Brand identity **Brand:** JCROWN DIGITALS **Owner:** Jediah Akeredolu **Brand colours:** Premium black and gold. Use: - Deep black for the main background and prominent sections. - Elegant gold for important headings, buttons, borders, and accents. - White and soft ivory for readable body text. - Subtle c...\n25: \n26: **Files changed:** none\n27: \n28: **Verification:** no commands were run\n29: \n30: **Error:** Network error: fetch failed\n31: \n32: _0 tool calls, 50s, 0 memories saved_\n33: \n34: ### 10/29/2026, 12:55:36 PM | failed | build | dahl:MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.7\n35: \n36: **Request:** Continue\n37: \n38: **Files changed:** none\n39: \n40: **Verification:** no commands were run\n41: \n42: **Error:** Network